OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1785592073
OL,3,C'Dangerous' child sex offender jailed
OL,4,Cfor 22 years
OL,6,FA rapist from Hampshire has been
OL,7,Fjailed after pleading guilty to more
OL,8,Fthan 20 child sexual abuse offences.
OL,10,FPaul Hopkins, from Romsey, admitted to
OL,11,Fraping a girl in the UK and arranging
OL,12,Fthe livestreaming of abuse of another
OL,13,Fin the Philippines.
OL,15,FThe 50-year-old was sentenced to 22
OL,16,Fyears in prison, with a further eight
OL,17,Fyears to be served on licence, at
OL,18,FBournemouth Crown Court earlier this
OL,19,Fweek.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/4
