PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1785592073
OL,3,C'Dangerous' child sex offender jailed
OL,4,Cfor 22 years
OL,6,FHe was also handed a Sexual Harm
OL,7,FPrevention Order.
OL,9,FHopkins was arrested in March 2025,
OL,10,Ffollowing an investigation by the
OL,11,FSouth West Regional Organised Crime
OL,12,FUnit (SWROCU).
OL,14,FOfficers found that he was attempting
OL,15,Fto make plans online to meet and
OL,16,Fsexually abuse a young girl.
OL,18,FThis led to the discovery that Hopkins
OL,19,Fwas livestreaming the abuse of a nine-
OL,20,Fyear-old girl in the Philippines.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/4
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
