OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,387,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1785592073
OL,3,C'Dangerous' child sex offender jailed
OL,4,Cfor 22 years
OL,6,FThe girl's mother facilitated this
OL,7,Foffence. She has since been arrested.
OL,9,FFurther evidence found on devices
OL,10,Fbelonging to Hopkins helped prove his
OL,11,Fguilt of the rape, attempted rape and
OL,12,Fsexual assault of a young girl in the
OL,13,FUK.
OL,15,FDetective Inspector Dave Wells, from
OL,16,Fthe Online Investigations Team at
OL,17,FSWROCU, called Hopkins the "most
OL,18,Fdangerous sex offender" his team has
OL,19,Fever investigated.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/4
